  "solution": {
    "text": "AC power gain = <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br/><br/>= <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub></math><br/><br/>where <math><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub></math> is AC current gain.<br/><br/>Also,<br/><br/><math><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br/><br/>Given, <math><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math><br/><br/>Hence,   50 = <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br/><br/><math><mo>∴</mo></math> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math><br/><br/>Now, AC power gain = <math><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub></math> = 50 <math><mo>×</mo></math> 25 = 1250",
